---
Draw filter frequency response curve in synth editor.

Show a visual representation of the biquad filter's frequency response
so users can see the effect of cutoff and resonance.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Frequency response curve drawn on Nuklear canvas
- [ ] X axis: frequency (log scale, 20Hz to 20kHz)
- [ ] Y axis: amplitude (dB, -24dB to +12dB)
- [ ] Curve updates in real time as cutoff/resonance change
- [ ] Shows correct shape for LP, HP, BP filter types

## Test Plan
- [ ] Adjust cutoff, verify curve moves horizontally
- [ ] Adjust resonance, verify peak at cutoff frequency
- [ ] Switch filter types, verify curve shape changes
- [ ] Visual: curve looks correct for known filter settings
